# Torah Study Automation Plan

## Goal
Implement a Python-based automation system that creates a daily study report using Torah APIs (TorahCalc, Shas.org) and sends it to Telegram.

## Proposed Changes
- [NEW] `lanzador_estudio.py`: Main Python script for automation.
- [NEW] `config.json`: Configuration file for Telegram credentials and location.
- [NEW] `ejecutar_estudio.bat`: Batch file to launch the script easily.

## Verification
- Run the script manually to verify API connections.
- Test Telegram notification (if credentials provided).
- Verify directory existence.
